here's my copy of an artifact spoiler file.  It lists the various
artifact weapons as well as the quest artifacts; choose for yourself
what is "best". 

Little spoilers:

I'm a big fan of mjollnir, probably followed by vorpal
blade and magicbane (because magicbane confers magic resistance, which
isn't a problem for you as a wiz, I suppose).  Frost and Fire Brand are
excellent too.  Cleaver is OK.  Ogresmasher, Dragonbane, and
Giantslayer pretty much suck IMO.

big spoilers:


Hints:
 1) wizards always get magicbane first.  Valks get Mjollnir.  
    barbarians get cleaver.  Probably some other classes
    get a specific weapon first too.  
 2) Don't enchant magicbane with enchant weapon scrolls.  as the
    name implies, it doesn't like to be enchanted; you lose
    the stun attack or somesuch
 3) valkyries with strength 25 (gauntlets of power or rings of
    gain strength are the only ways to get this i think) can
    throw mjollnir and have it return to their hands.  
 4) as you start the game, you can name an elven dagger 
    Sting and it is "the" Sting, and gives you warning and a + against
    orcs.  I think you can do this with one other artifact but it's 
    hardly worth it; this doesn't work with the good ones

From: pmr@daneel.rdt.monash.edu.au (Paul Richardson)

This list is not necessarily complete or correct, but it's a good basic
guide. Info comes from my understanding of the source. (Highly suspect :-)

The 'mundane' artifacts. Lawful and neutral much more variety than
chaotics. Note the changes to some of the types of weapon when wishing,
e.g. Stormbringer is now a 'runesword' not a broadsword or ninja-to.

A class of monster in the Special column indicates bonuses against those
monsters only. The two columns '+hit' and '+dam' are the same as those
used in the Wheaton College Spoilers. I *think* they mean + to hit and
+ to damage, but not sure.

Name            Type              Align   +hit    +dam    Special
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Excalibur       long sword        L       5       10      seek, search, defend
Stormbringer    runesword         C       5       2       drain level, defend
Mjollnir        war hammer        N       5       24      electrical damage
Cleaver         battle axe        N       3       6
Grimtooth       orcish dagger     C       2       6
Orcrist         elven broadsword  L       5       0       orcs
Sting           elven dagger      L       5       0       orcs, warning
Magicbane       athame            N       3       4       stuns opponent
Frost Brand     long sword        N       5       0       cold damage
Fire Brand      long sword        N       5       0       fire damage
Dragonbane      broadsword        N       5       0       dragons
Demonbane       long sword        L       5       0       demons
Werebane        silver saber      L       5       0       were-things
Grayswandir     silver saber      L       5       0       (silver damage also)
Giantslayer     long sword        N       5       0       giants
Ogresmasher     war hammer        N       5       0       ogres
Trollsbane      morning star      L       5       0       trolls
Vorpal Blade    long sword        N       5       1       beheads!
Snickersnee     katana            L       0       8
Sunsword        long sword        L       5       0       undead

------------------------------------------------------------------------------

